## Executive Summary

Claude Haiku 5.5 is Anthropic's smallest and fastest model in the Claude 5.5 family, released October 7, 2026, designed for high-volume, latency-sensitive applications including classification, extraction, routing, and subagent work. It features a massive 1M token context window, highly competitive pricing ($0.10/$0.50 per 1M tokens for requests up to 100K tokens), and exceptional speed (234 tokens per second, fastest in Claude 5.5 family). Haiku 5.5 ranks #12 on Vals Index with 58.71%, #3 on Vibe Code Bench v1.1 (67.2%), and costs 90% less than Claude Haiku 4.5 for requests up to 100K tokens. The model is available through Anthropic API, Amazon Bedrock, Google Cloud, Microsoft Foundry, and Claude Platform on AWS.

