- Claude Haiku 5.5 vs Claude Sonnet 5.5: Haiku 5.5 is 90% cheaper on input ($0.10/$0.50 vs $2/$10) and 80% cheaper on output ($0.50/$2.50 vs $10/$20), but Sonnet 5.5 leads on intelligence (56 vs 43)
- Claude Haiku 5.5 vs Claude Opus 5.5: Haiku 5.5 is 95% cheaper on input ($0.10/$0.50 vs $4/$20) and 75% cheaper on output ($0.50/$2.50 vs $20/$50)
- Claude Haiku 5.5 vs GPT-6 Luna: Haiku 5.5 is 90% cheaper on input ($0.10/$0.50 vs $0.10/$0.50), same cost on input, but Luna is 500% cheaper on output ($0.50 vs $0.50)
- Claude Haiku 5.5 vs GPT-5.6 Sol: GPT-5.6 Sol is 80% cheaper on input ($2/$10 vs $0.10/$0.50) but Haiku 5.5 is 50% cheaper on output ($0.50 vs $10)
- Claude Haiku 5.5 pricing: $0.10/$0.50 per 1M tokens (up to 100K tokens), $0.50/$2.50 per 1M tokens (over 100K tokens)

